[Comment]
Den squad leader. Uses the existing companion commands; Merc forwards their final values to the owner's squad.

[Dialog]
Speech 1
  Answer 2
    Demand Script DenDefense::CanCommand
  Answer Exit

Speech 2
  Answer Exit
    Result Script DenDefense::Follow
  Answer Exit*
    Result Script DenDefense::Wait
  Answer Exit**
    Result Script DenDefense::ToggleDefend
  Answer Exit***
    Result Script DenDefense::ToggleAssist
  Answer Exit****
  Answer Exit*****
    Result Script DenDefense::HolsterWeapons
  Answer Exit******
    Result Script DenDefense::ReadyWeapons
  Answer Exit*******
    Result Script DenDefense::CollectLoot

[Text russ]
{Name}{}{Главный наёмник}
{Speech 1}{}{Я старший в нашем отряде. Какие будут приказы?}
{Speech 1 Answer 2}{}{Передай приказ всем моим наёмникам.}
{Speech 1 Answer Exit}{}{Ничего.}
{Speech 2}{}{Слушаю. Все твои наёмники получат тот же приказ, что и я. Защиту и помощь в атаке можно переключать независимо.}
{Speech 2 Answer Exit}{}{Всем следовать за мной.}
{Speech 2 Answer Exit*}{}{Всем ждать на месте.}
{Speech 2 Answer Exit**}{}{Переключи защиту меня от нападений у всего отряда.}
{Speech 2 Answer Exit***}{}{Переключи помощь в моих атаках у всего отряда.}
{Speech 2 Answer Exit****}{}{Пока без изменений.}
{Speech 2 Answer Exit*****}{}{Не светите пушками, нарваться хотите?}
{Speech 2 Answer Exit******}{}{Так, че расслабились - кулаки размяли, оружие к бою}
{Speech 2 Answer Exit*******}{}{Соберите всё полезное с этих жмуриков. Патроны, медикаменты, крышки — нам пригодится абсолютно всё}

[Text engl]
{Name}{}{Mercenary leader}
{Speech 1}{}{I lead our squad. What are your orders?}
{Speech 1 Answer 2}{}{Pass my order to all my mercenaries.}
{Speech 1 Answer Exit}{}{Nothing.}
{Speech 2}{}{I am listening. All your mercenaries will receive the same order as me. Defend and assist can be toggled independently.}
{Speech 2 Answer Exit}{}{Everyone, follow me.}
{Speech 2 Answer Exit*}{}{Everyone, wait where you are.}
{Speech 2 Answer Exit**}{}{Toggle defending me against attackers for the whole squad.}
{Speech 2 Answer Exit***}{}{Toggle assisting my attacks for the whole squad.}
{Speech 2 Answer Exit****}{}{No changes for now.}
{Speech 2 Answer Exit*****}{}{Stop flashing your guns. Looking for trouble?}
{Speech 2 Answer Exit******}{}{Getting soft, are we? Flex those fists, weapons ready!}
{Speech 2 Answer Exit*******}{}{Collect everything useful from those stiffs. Ammo, medicine, caps — we will need absolutely everything.}
